window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When I find myself snowed in and alone while I'm supposed to be on a girls' trip in the mountains, there's a knock on the door I don't expect.</b></p> <p>I open it to find three sexy strangers who are about to turn my whole world upside down. Realization that we're scent matches has them feral and determined. That's how I found myself thrown over one of their shoulders and swept away to their cabin.</p> <p>Life isn't a fairytale, and when my heat breaks, I'm back in Calling Wood with a broken heart. To make things more complicated, I find myself pregnant. Knowing I can't keep this to myself, I need to go back to the little mountain town and let them know.</p> <p>Seeing them again, I expect the worst. I'm wrong and spent so much time away from them for nothing.</p> <p>Now I have my dream pack, a baby on the way, and a life I've always wanted. But that's not proven as easy as we'd like when there's someone determined to take what's rightfully mine.</p>"; 
